  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a crowded Tokyo club, Toshi and bookstore manager Kitamori secretly meet Muranishi with cash in a locker. Hearing that police harassment has shaken all the branch managers back north, Muranishi agrees to return to Hokkaido and packs up late at night. Listen to the Japanese first, then we'll go through it together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "村西とおるだな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "くだらんことをするな。金は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "会長、お元気そうで。いつものロッカーに。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "会社のほうは何とかやってますが、お客さん減っちゃって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "苦労かけるな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "三日後、大丈夫ですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "長い間会長不在で、支店長がみんな動揺してて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "顔だけでも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かった。行くよ、北海道に。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "北海道、涼しいのか？どんな格好したらいいのか忘れたよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何日か空けるかもしれない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "いつでも帰ってきてねってさ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "村西とおるだな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're Toru Muranishi, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "くだらんことをするな。金は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cut out the nonsense. Where's the money?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "会長、お元気そうで。いつものロッカーに。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairman, you look well. It's in the usual locker.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "会社のほうは何とかやってますが、お客さん減っちゃって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We're managing to keep the company running somehow, though we've lost customers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "苦労かけるな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry to put you through such trouble.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "三日後、大丈夫ですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you still okay to come in three days?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "長い間会長不在で、支店長がみんな動揺してて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With the chairman absent for so long, all the branch managers are rattled.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "顔だけでも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even just showing your face would help.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かった。行くよ、北海道に。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Understood. I'll go to Hokkaido.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "北海道、涼しいのか？どんな格好したらいいのか忘れたよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is Hokkaido cool right now? I've forgotten what kind of clothes to wear.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何日か空けるかもしれない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I might be away for a few days.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "いつでも帰ってきてねってさ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She told you to come back anytime.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
